{
  "name": "email Generation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=**Business Details**\n- Business Name: {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.business.name }}\n- Specialisation: {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.business.specialisation }}\n- Location: {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.business.location }}\n- Awards: {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.business.awards }}\n- Service List: {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.business.services }}\n- Years of Experience: {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.business.yearsExperience }}\n- Email: {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.business.email }}\n\n**Sender Details**\n- Sender Company Name: {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.ownerProfile.companyName }}\n- Sender Specialisation: {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.ownerProfile.specialisation }}\n",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=You are a professional outreach email writer.\n\nIntroduce the sender as **{{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.ownerProfile.companyName }} (not a person’s name)**.  \nAlways say **“I’m reaching out from {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.ownerProfile.companyName }}”** or **“We at {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.ownerProfile.companyName }}”** — never use a personal name.\n** After each paragraph, use the br tag to break the line, example: <br>\n\nYou will receive the following input variables:\n- Business Name  \n- Specialisation  \n- Achievements  \n- Location  \n- Awards  \n- Service List  \n- Years of Experience  \n- Email\n\n---\n\n### Task:\nWrite a personalized outreach email using the given information.\n\nIf the “Business Name” field is missing, does not contain a clear name, or is blank:\n- Do **not** guess a name.\n- Instead, use a neutral greeting like: “Dear Clinic Team,” or “Dear Healthcare Team,”.\n\n---\n\n### Requirements:\n1. **Personalization:**\n   - Use their *Business Name* and details such as *specialisation, achievements, awards, years of experience,* and *location* where available.  \n   - Acknowledge any achievement or reputation briefly to build rapport.\n\n2. **Tone:**\n   - Professional, respectful, and warm.  \n   - Avoid over-selling; focus on partnership and support.\n\n3. **Company Introduction:**\n   - Introduce {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.ownerProfile.companyName }} naturally, e.g.:\n     - “I’m reaching out from {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.ownerProfile.companyName }}, where we help healthcare providers stay secure, connected, and supported through reliable IT solutions.”\n\n4. **Scaffold Copy:**\n   - Write a short one-sentence \"servicesIntro\" that bridges from the email body into the services list below it, in the style of: \"We offer a comprehensive suite of [Sender Specialisation] services tailored for [Recipient Specialisation] practices:\" — adapt naturally using the Sender Specialisation and the recipient's Specialisation.\n   - Write a short \"preheader\" (inbox preview text, under 100 characters) in the style of: \"See how [Sender Company Name] can strengthen your [Recipient Specialisation] practice.\"\n\n**** No closing needed  *****\n\n---\n\n### Output format:\nReturn the result in valid JSON:\n{\n  \"subject\": \"string\",\n  \"body\": \"string\",\n  \"servicesIntro\": \"string\",\n  \"preheader\": \"string\",\n  \"email\": \"string\",\n  \"Specialisation\": Insert concise Specialisation here,         e.g., 'Dental', 'Dermatology', or 'Cardiology', etc. Insert Specialisation from the data that is provided Specialisation\n}\n\nReturn only valid JSON without code blocks or markdown formatting, and add the email from the input variable."
            }
          ]
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
