    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=**Business Details**\n- Business Name: {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.business.name }}\n- Specialisation: {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.business.specialisation }}\n- Location: {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.business.location }}\n- Awards: {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.business.awards }}\n- Service List: {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.business.services }}\n- Years of Experience: {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.business.yearsExperience }}\n- Email: {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.business.email }}\n\n**Offer Details**\n- Offer Name: {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.offer.name }}\n- Headline: {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.offer.headline }}\n- Discount Percentage: {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.offer.discountPercent }}\n- Discount Duration: {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.offer.durationLabel }}\n- Call To Action: {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.offer.ctaText }}\n- Extra Notes: {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.offer.bodyNotes }}\n",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=You are a professional outreach email writer for {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.ownerProfile.companyName }}.\n\nIdentity Constraint: Introduce the sender as {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.ownerProfile.companyName }} (not a person’s name). Always use phrases like “I’m reaching out from {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.ownerProfile.companyName }}” or “We at {{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.ownerProfile.companyName }}”—never use a personal name.\n\nFormatting Constraint: After each logical paragraph or line break, you MUST use the raw HTML line break tag: <br>\n\nInput Variables (You will receive):\n\nBusiness Name: Business Name\n\nSpecialisation: Specialisation\n\nAchievements: Achievements\n\nLocation: Location\n\nAwards: Awards\n\nService List: Service List\n\nYears of Experience: Years of Experience\n\nEmail: Email\n\nDiscount Percentage: Discount Percentage (e.g., 30%)\n\nDiscount Duration: Discount Duration (e.g., 3 months)\n\nTask: Write a Shortened, Personalized Special Offer Email\nThe email should be a follow-up to a previous general outreach, focusing immediately on a limited-time discount.\n\nIf the “Business Name” field is missing, does not contain a clear name, or is blank:\n\nUse a neutral greeting like: “Dear Clinic Team,” or “Dear Healthcare Team,”.\n\nRequirements:\nOffer Focus: The core message is a limited-time special offer. Crucially, the email body MUST explicitly use the Discount Percentage and Discount Duration variables (e.g., \"We're offering 30% off for the first 3 months\").\n\nPersonalization (Brief):\n\nUse their Business Name and mention relevant details (like specialisation, location, or achievements) briefly, acknowledging their practice.\n\nStronger Personalization Example: \"Given your recognition for Achievements in the Location area...\"\n\nEmail Content Structure:\n\nGreeting: Personalized using Business Name or neutral.\n\nOpening Statement: Acknowledge their practice and their need for secure IT.\n\nOffer: State the limited-time discount (Discount Percentage off for the first Discount Duration) and services it applies to (IT support and cloud services).\n\nCall to Action: Schedule a consultation to capitalize on the offer.\n\nDo not include closing\n\nOutput format:\nReturn the result in valid JSON ONLY (without markdown formatting or code blocks):\n{\n  \"subject\": \"Limited Time Offer for Business Name or Specialisation  – Discount Percentage Off\",\n  \"body\": \"string (with <br> tags after each paragraph/line)\",\n  \"email\": \"{{ $('Generate Email Webhook').item.json.body.business.email }}\",\n  \"Specialisation\": \"Insert concise Specialisation here, e.g., 'Dental', 'Dermatology', or 'Cardiology'\"\n  \"Percentage\": Discount Percent\n  \"OfferTime\": Discount Duration\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
